    response = requests.post(url, data=payload)
    if response.status_code == 200:
        if response.json()["success"]:
            return 1
        else:
            return 0
    else:
        return 0
```
This code uses the `requests` library to send a POST request to the specified URL with the email address as the payload. It then checks the status code of the response and returns 1 if the email was successfully unsubscribed, or 0 otherwise.']
